WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.181 --> 00:00:16.242
Thursday morning Ben and Gaby walked to school.

2
00:00:19.863 --> 00:00:23.165
weird," Gaby burst out as they got close to the school building.

3
00:00:23.185 --> 00:00:24.645
"What's weird?"

4
00:00:24.986 --> 00:00:25.706
Ben asked.

5
00:00:26.966 --> 00:00:27.627
She pointed.

6
00:00:28.107 --> 00:00:30.448
Kids and teachers stood outside the main doors.

7
00:00:31.712 --> 00:00:33.273
"It's almost time for the first bell.

8
00:00:33.753 --> 00:00:34.333
How come Mr.

9
00:00:34.393 --> 00:00:36.174
Freaky hasn't unlocked the doors yet?"

10
00:00:37.374 --> 00:00:40.615
Before Ben could reply, the school doors flew open.

11
00:00:41.215 --> 00:00:44.056
Mr. Freaky came racing out, followed by Ms.

12
00:00:44.096 --> 00:00:44.676
Van Ghoul.

13
00:00:45.457 --> 00:00:47.517
The principal was wringing his hands.

14
00:00:48.638 --> 00:00:50.958
"Students, this is a disaster!"

15
00:00:51.398 --> 00:00:51.939
he cried.

16
00:00:51.959 --> 00:00:55.640
"Art Week is completely out of control!"

17
00:00:59.436 --> 00:01:02.257
Teachers and kids stepped cautiously into the building.

18
00:01:02.277 --> 00:01:05.319
"Oh no," Ben murmured.

19
00:01:05.959 --> 00:01:07.640
The vandal had struck again.

20
00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:09.900
Sculptures had been knocked over.

21
00:01:10.601 --> 00:01:14.322
Pottery, baskets, and spider web weavings lay everywhere.

22
00:01:15.523 --> 00:01:21.705
Paintings and drawings hung crookedly from the walls, and the big Art Week banner dangled from one side.

23
00:01:21.725 --> 00:01:25.427
"This is awful!"

24
00:01:25.507 --> 00:01:27.408
Mr. Freaky wrung his hands again.

25
00:01:28.772 --> 00:01:29.933
"What are we going to do, Ms.

26
00:01:29.973 --> 00:01:30.634
Van Ghoul?

27
00:01:31.014 --> 00:01:33.737
Leonardo da Creepy will be here at ten o'clock!"

28
00:01:34.618 --> 00:01:35.759
"Who could have done this?"

29
00:01:36.199 --> 00:01:36.860
Gaby said.

30
00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:39.822
Several heads spun toward the Doppel Gang.

31
00:01:39.842 --> 00:01:41.804
"No way!

32
00:01:41.924 --> 00:01:42.545
It wasn't us!"

33
00:01:42.945 --> 00:01:43.506
Moe said.

34
00:01:44.046 --> 00:01:46.749
Larry and Carly shook their heads furiously.

35
00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:50.072
Ms. Van Ghoul's eyes looked glazed.

36
00:01:50.092 --> 00:01:54.316
"It's not so bad," she said in a tight voice.

37
00:01:58.444 --> 00:02:02.647
Then she fluttered around, picking up a pot and putting it back on its stand.

38
00:02:02.667 --> 00:02:06.550
"We just need to do a little cleanup."

39
00:02:07.451 --> 00:02:08.812
"A little cleanup?"

40
00:02:09.312 --> 00:02:09.953
Ben thought.

41
00:02:09.973 --> 00:02:12.535
"This place is a disaster zone!"

42
00:02:13.535 --> 00:02:16.478
Mr. Freaky took out his handkerchief and mopped his head.

43
00:02:16.498 --> 00:02:20.420
"Hey!" A fish monster pointed to a painting.

44
00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:24.844
"My piranha family portrait was hanging there yesterday.

45
00:02:26.968 --> 00:02:29.330
Someone else made this painting to look like it!"

46
00:02:30.591 --> 00:02:31.711
A blob gasped.

47
00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:35.254
"I see a bad copy of my painting too!"

48
00:02:35.274 --> 00:02:40.177
"That's not my artwork either," a goblin said.

49
00:02:40.197 --> 00:02:44.220
"Whoever painted that thing must have been half asleep!"

50
00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:47.042
"Everyone, calm down."

51
00:02:47.362 --> 00:02:48.503
Ms. Van Ghoul sighed.

52
00:02:48.523 --> 00:02:52.986
"Mr. Freaky will investigate while the rest of us clean up."

53
00:02:54.187 --> 00:02:55.888
"Me? Investigate?"

54
00:02:56.304 --> 00:02:57.785
Mr. Freaky spun around.

55
00:02:57.805 --> 00:02:59.287
"Where's Ben?"

56
00:02:59.547 --> 00:03:00.267
he demanded.

57
00:03:00.287 --> 00:03:03.310
"He's writing a story about Art Week for the paper.

58
00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:06.372
And that's what reporters do—they investigate!"

59
00:03:06.392 --> 00:03:08.674
"I'm working on it, Mr.

60
00:03:08.734 --> 00:03:10.175
Freaky," Ben mumbled.

61
00:03:10.195 --> 00:03:13.498
"Okay, monsters, all claws on deck!"

62
00:03:13.818 --> 00:03:14.819
Ms. Van Ghoul said.

63
00:03:17.081 --> 00:03:20.544
The monsters worked all morning to clean up the wrecked exhibits.

64
00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:28.382
Just as Ben and another ghost finished rehanging the Art Week banner, Leonardo da Creepy arrived.

65
00:03:28.402 --> 00:03:30.722
"He's here!"

66
00:03:30.742 --> 00:03:32.323
Mr. Freaky cried.

67
00:03:32.343 --> 00:03:34.103
"Get ready!"

68
00:03:36.444 --> 00:03:41.025
A tall ghoul with a long beard and a red beret strode into the building.

69
00:03:42.526 --> 00:03:44.646
Ms. Van Ghoul hurried over to greet him.

70
00:03:44.666 --> 00:03:47.307
"Mr. da Creepy!

71
00:03:47.547 --> 00:03:50.888
We're so glad you're able to participate in Art Week!"

72
00:03:51.848 --> 00:03:53.349
Mr. da Creepy frowned.

73
00:03:53.369 --> 00:03:55.471
"I'm not participating yet.

74
00:03:56.011 --> 00:03:57.832
I've come to inspect the artwork.

75
00:03:58.553 --> 00:04:00.895
Things must be up to my standards, you know."

76
00:04:00.915 --> 00:04:02.876
"Oh yes.

77
00:04:02.996 --> 00:04:04.557
I'm aware of that," Ms.

78
00:04:04.597 --> 00:04:05.358
Van Ghoul said.

79
00:04:05.378 --> 00:04:10.141
"If you'll follow me, I'll show you the fabulous artwork on display.

80
00:04:10.702 --> 00:04:14.464
The students have been working very hard to make Art Week great!"

81
00:04:15.325 --> 00:04:17.026
Leonardo da Creepy grunted.

82
00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:29.942
Ben followed the adults through the school, taking notes for his article.

83
00:04:32.323 --> 00:04:38.467
As they strolled along, Ben noticed that Leonardo da Creepy did not look impressed with the students' work.

84
00:04:39.007 --> 00:04:41.528
The artist's lip seemed to curl with distaste.

85
00:04:41.548 --> 00:04:44.730
"I must say, Ms.

86
00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:46.411
Van Ghoul," Mr.

87
00:04:46.431 --> 00:04:51.714
da Creepy said, "many of these artists do not take art very seriously."

88
00:04:53.234 --> 00:04:54.835
The smile slipped from Ms.

89
00:04:54.875 --> 00:04:55.756
Van Ghoul's face.

90
00:04:57.864 --> 00:05:01.846
"Oh, we're very serious about art here at Monster Academy!

91
00:05:02.487 --> 00:05:07.029
If you need more proof of that, I can show you an amazing work in progress.

92
00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:11.952
It's a flying painting—have you ever seen one?"

93
00:05:12.912 --> 00:05:15.093
Leonardo da Creepy raised his eyebrows.

94
00:05:15.113 --> 00:05:18.835
"Did you say, a flying painting?"

95
00:05:18.855 --> 00:05:23.018
"Yes, we have a flying painting.

96
00:05:23.478 --> 00:05:25.799
The witches are still working on it," Ms.

97
00:05:25.839 --> 00:05:27.060
Van Ghoul said proudly.

98
00:05:27.732 --> 00:05:30.995
"And when it's finished, it's going to be breathtaking."

99
00:05:31.015 --> 00:05:33.837
"Oh." Mr.

100
00:05:33.857 --> 00:05:35.578
da Creepy's tone had changed.

101
00:05:35.598 --> 00:05:37.239
"May I see it?"

102
00:05:37.259 --> 00:05:58.344
"Certainly." Ben heard Leonardo da Creepy gasp as they all entered the gym.

103
00:05:58.364 --> 00:06:00.465
"Now, this is what I call art!"

104
00:06:00.805 --> 00:06:01.426
he gushed.

105
00:06:02.126 --> 00:06:05.968
"Why, I'd be delighted to participate in the festivities tomorrow night."

106
00:06:05.988 --> 00:06:08.630
"Phew!" Mr.

107
00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:10.070
Freaky let out his breath.

108
00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:13.052
"Does that mean you'll still donate your painting?"

109
00:06:13.072 --> 00:06:15.573
"Of course," Mr.

110
00:06:15.613 --> 00:06:16.654
da Creepy replied.

111
00:06:16.674 --> 00:06:20.156
"In fact, I just finished painting it this morning.

112
00:06:21.837 --> 00:06:24.998
I think the Monster Academy community will love it."

113
00:06:25.899 --> 00:06:27.580
Ms. Van Ghoul's face lit up.

114
00:06:28.064 --> 00:06:29.646
"Wonderful!" she said.

115
00:06:29.666 --> 00:06:33.269
"The ceremony will start tomorrow evening at seven."

116
00:06:33.289 --> 00:06:36.792
"Wait till I tell Winnie," Ben thought happily.

117
00:06:38.053 --> 00:06:42.817
The witches' flying painting wasn't finished yet, but it had already saved the day.

118
00:06:43.738 --> 00:06:49.183
Leonardo da Creepy was coming back to Monster Academy—with a magnificent painting of his own!
